 "description": "Tired of prepared defenses, I decided to try something with one of the other starting interrupts.",
 "strategy": "The strategy for this is pretty simple, hold the tatooine sites while capturing anybody that tries to come in.\n\nFirst turn, you should be able to get Fett, his gun, scum, and Lando out. With hidden weapons, defensive fires, and the none shall pass they should be safe for a while. From that, just keep setting up drains untill they decide to come to tatooine.\n\nIf they show up, Fett should have no problem capturing them for a quick feeding to the rancor or Sarlac. If that doesn't work, I imagine a loss will follow very quickly.",
